Tasks/NSC-070.yaml:57:      "requirement": "WizardArtIntegrationTests enumerates all four wizard choices and all 32 idle/walk states and proves exact state-to-clip identity, ordered sprite membership, correct source-group identity, SpriteRenderer binding, import geometry, and pivot without requiring new PixelLab artwork."
